{
  "refId": "component-templates",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "source": "ADR-009 section 2 (port counts come from templates, the Plant 3D catalog-template pattern); ADR-010 section 2 (two-tier: universal read-only, project-defined additive)",
  "note": "This is the UNIVERSAL tier and it is read-only. A tee has three ports on every project in the world, so that fact ships with the release and cannot be redefined by a project. Projects may add their own templates but may NOT shadow a code used here - the same closed-vocabulary / configurable-subset split as FacilityKind::all() versus selectable() in ADR-004.",
  "portRoles": {
    "RUN": {"en": "Run", "fa": "مسیر اصلی"},
    "BRANCH": {"en": "Branch", "fa": "انشعاب"},
    "INLET": {"en": "Inlet", "fa": "ورودی"},
    "OUTLET": {"en": "Outlet", "fa": "خروجی"},
    "LARGE": {"en": "Large end", "fa": "سر بزرگ"},
    "SMALL": {"en": "Small end", "fa": "سر کوچک"},
    "NOZZLE": {"en": "Nozzle", "fa": "نازل"}
  },
  "sizeRules": {
    "SAME_AS_FIRST": "Every port takes the size of the first port. The component is a single-size item.",
    "INDEPENDENT": "Each port is sized independently by the user, subject to the constraint below.",
    "BRANCH_LE_RUN": "Branch port must be less than or equal to the run size; the two run ports are equal.",
    "LARGE_GT_SMALL": "The large port must be strictly greater than the small port."
  },
  "templates": [
    {
      "code": "PIPE",
      "name": {"en": "Pipe", "fa": "لوله"},
      "category": "PIPE",
      "sizeRule": "SAME_AS_FIRST",
      "hasLength": true,
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "BW"},
        {"seq": 2, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "BW"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "ELBOW",
      "name": {"en": "Elbow", "fa": "زانویی"},
      "category": "FITTING",
      "sizeRule": "SAME_AS_FIRST",
      "qualifiers": ["90LR", "90SR", "45", "180LR"],
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "BW"},
        {"seq": 2, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "BW"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "TEE",
      "name": {"en": "Tee", "fa": "سه‌راهی"},
      "category": "FITTING",
      "sizeRule": "BRANCH_LE_RUN",
      "qualifierDerived": true,
      "qualifiers": ["EQUAL", "REDUCING"],
      "note": {
        "en": "ONE component type, not two. Equal versus reducing is DERIVED from the port sizes at save time, never chosen by the user - user decision recorded in ADR-009 section 6.",
        "fa": "یک نوع کامپوننت است نه دو تا. مساوی یا تبدیلی بودن از روی سایز پورت‌ها استنتاج می‌شود، نه انتخاب کاربر."
      },
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "BW"},
        {"seq": 2, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "BW"},
        {"seq": 3, "role": "BRANCH", "defaultEnd": "BW"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "CROSS",
      "name": {"en": "Cross", "fa": "چهارراهی"},
      "category": "FITTING",
      "sizeRule": "BRANCH_LE_RUN",
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "BW"},
        {"seq": 2, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "BW"},
        {"seq": 3, "role": "BRANCH", "defaultEnd": "BW"},
        {"seq": 4, "role": "BRANCH", "defaultEnd": "BW"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "REDUCER",
      "name": {"en": "Reducer", "fa": "تبدیل"},
      "category": "FITTING",
      "sizeRule": "LARGE_GT_SMALL",
      "qualifiers": ["CONCENTRIC", "ECCENTRIC"],
      "note": {
        "en": "The only two-port component whose ports differ in size. A reducing weld is where the smaller-diameter dia-inch convention actually bites (ADR-010 section 1) - the test fixture must contain one.",
        "fa": "تنها کامپوننت دوپورته که دو سرش هم‌اندازه نیست. قرارداد «قطر کوچکتر» در دیا اینچ دقیقاً اینجا اثر می‌گذارد."
      },
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "LARGE", "defaultEnd": "BW"},
        {"seq": 2, "role": "SMALL", "defaultEnd": "BW"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "SWAGE",
      "name": {"en": "Swage", "fa": "سوئیج"},
      "category": "FITTING",
      "sizeRule": "LARGE_GT_SMALL",
      "qualifiers": ["CONCENTRIC", "ECCENTRIC"],
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "LARGE", "defaultEnd": "PL"},
        {"seq": 2, "role": "SMALL", "defaultEnd": "PL"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "OLET",
      "name": {"en": "Branch fitting (olet)", "fa": "اولت"},
      "category": "FITTING",
      "sizeRule": "BRANCH_LE_RUN",
      "qualifiers": ["WELDOLET", "SOCKOLET", "THREDOLET", "ELBOLET", "NIPOLET"],
      "note": {
        "en": "Two ports: the run port attaches to the header pipe wall rather than to a pipe end, so it is consumed by the header component, not by a free pipe end.",
        "fa": "دو پورت دارد؛ پورت ران به بدنه لوله اصلی می‌چسبد نه به سر لوله."
      },
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "FA", "attachesToBody": true},
        {"seq": 2, "role": "BRANCH", "defaultEnd": "BW"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "FLANGE",
      "name": {"en": "Flange", "fa": "فلنج"},
      "category": "FLANGE",
      "sizeRule": "SAME_AS_FIRST",
      "qualifiers": ["WN", "SO", "BL", "SW", "THD", "LJ"],
      "requiresRating": true,
      "requiresFacing": true,
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "BW"},
        {"seq": 2, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "FL"}
      ],
      "note": {
        "en": "Asymmetric by nature: one end welds to the pipe, the other bolts. A blind flange (BL) has only the FL port - handled by the qualifier, not by a separate template.",
        "fa": "ذاتاً نامتقارن است: یک سر به لوله جوش می‌شود و سر دیگر پیچ. فلنج کور فقط پورت FL دارد."
      }
    },
    {
      "code": "GASKET",
      "name": {"en": "Gasket", "fa": "واشر"},
      "category": "FLANGE",
      "sizeRule": "SAME_AS_FIRST",
      "requiresRating": true,
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "FL"},
        {"seq": 2, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "FL"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "VALVE",
      "name": {"en": "Valve", "fa": "شیر"},
      "category": "VALVE",
      "sizeRule": "SAME_AS_FIRST",
      "qualifiers": ["GATE", "GLOBE", "BALL", "CHECK", "BUTTERFLY", "PLUG", "NEEDLE", "DIAPHRAGM"],
      "requiresRating": true,
      "isTagged": true,
      "directional": true,
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "INLET", "defaultEnd": "FL"},
        {"seq": 2, "role": "OUTLET", "defaultEnd": "FL"}
      ],
      "note": {
        "en": "Directional: a check valve installed backwards is a real defect, so inlet and outlet are distinct roles even though they are the same size.",
        "fa": "جهت‌دار است: نصب معکوس شیر یک‌طرفه یک عیب واقعی است، پس ورودی و خروجی نقش‌های متمایزی دارند."
      }
    },
    {
      "code": "CONTROL_VALVE",
      "name": {"en": "Control valve", "fa": "شیر کنترل"},
      "category": "VALVE",
      "sizeRule": "SAME_AS_FIRST",
      "requiresRating": true,
      "isTagged": true,
      "directional": true,
      "instrument": true,
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "INLET", "defaultEnd": "FL"},
        {"seq": 2, "role": "OUTLET", "defaultEnd": "FL"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "THREE_WAY_VALVE",
      "name": {"en": "Three-way valve", "fa": "شیر سه‌راهه"},
      "category": "VALVE",
      "sizeRule": "SAME_AS_FIRST",
      "requiresRating": true,
      "isTagged": true,
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "INLET", "defaultEnd": "FL"},
        {"seq": 2, "role": "OUTLET", "defaultEnd": "FL"},
        {"seq": 3, "role": "OUTLET", "defaultEnd": "FL"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "INSTRUMENT",
      "name": {"en": "In-line instrument", "fa": "ابزار دقیق درون‌خطی"},
      "category": "INSTRUMENT",
      "sizeRule": "SAME_AS_FIRST",
      "qualifiers": ["ORIFICE", "FLOW_METER", "SIGHT_GLASS", "STRAINER"],
      "isTagged": true,
      "directional": true,
      "instrument": true,
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "INLET", "defaultEnd": "FL"},
        {"seq": 2, "role": "OUTLET", "defaultEnd": "FL"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "CAP",
      "name": {"en": "Cap", "fa": "کپ"},
      "category": "FITTING",
      "sizeRule": "SAME_AS_FIRST",
      "terminates": true,
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "BW"}
      ],
      "note": {
        "en": "A one-port component. Placing it CLOSES an open end - which is how a line stops being reported as incomplete without anyone editing a status field.",
        "fa": "کامپوننت تک‌پورته. قرار دادنش یک سر باز را می‌بندد و خط بدون دست‌کاری وضعیت، از فهرست ناتمام خارج می‌شود."
      }
    },
    {
      "code": "BLIND",
      "name": {"en": "Blind / spade", "fa": "بلایند یا اسپید"},
      "category": "FLANGE",
      "sizeRule": "SAME_AS_FIRST",
      "requiresRating": true,
      "terminates": true,
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "FL"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "UNION",
      "name": {"en": "Union", "fa": "یونیون"},
      "category": "FITTING",
      "sizeRule": "SAME_AS_FIRST",
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "SC"},
        {"seq": 2, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "SC"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "COUPLING",
      "name": {"en": "Coupling", "fa": "کوپلینگ"},
      "category": "FITTING",
      "sizeRule": "SAME_AS_FIRST",
      "qualifiers": ["FULL", "HALF", "REDUCING"],
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "SW"},
        {"seq": 2, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "SW"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "NIPPLE",
      "name": {"en": "Nipple", "fa": "نیپل"},
      "category": "PIPE",
      "sizeRule": "SAME_AS_FIRST",
      "hasLength": true,
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "SC"},
        {"seq": 2, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "SC"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "SPECTACLE_BLIND",
      "name": {"en": "Spectacle blind", "fa": "عینکی"},
      "category": "FLANGE",
      "sizeRule": "SAME_AS_FIRST",
      "requiresRating": true,
      "isTagged": true,
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "FL"},
        {"seq": 2, "role": "RUN", "defaultEnd": "FL"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "NOZZLE",
      "name": {"en": "Equipment nozzle", "fa": "نازل تجهیز"},
      "category": "EQUIPMENT",
      "sizeRule": "SAME_AS_FIRST",
      "ownerKind": "NOZZLE",
      "isTagged": true,
      "requiresRating": true,
      "requiresFacing": true,
      "ports": [
        {"seq": 1, "role": "NOZZLE", "defaultEnd": "FL"}
      ],
      "note": {
        "en": "A nozzle is a PORT OWNER, not a line component (ADR-010 section 3). It appears in this pack because the port-creation machinery is identical - one template, one port - but its owner_kind is NOZZLE, so it belongs to a piece of equipment rather than to a piping line. This is what lets a pipe-to-nozzle joint use the joints table unchanged.",
        "fa": "نازل مالک پورت است نه کامپوننت خط. در همین بسته می‌آید چون ساز و کار ساخت پورت یکسان است، اما owner_kind آن NOZZLE است و به تجهیز تعلق دارد نه به خط لوله."
      }
    }
  ]
}
